      "content": "hey, quick question. im on some hydrocodone for my back pain (the stuff with tylenol in it) and it's making it real hard for me to get to sleep at night cause of the grogginess but i cant stop the pain. i was thinking about taking some benadryl right before bed to help me knock out. is that cool to take them together?",
