      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is always so busy and it’s hard to get an appointment just for something like this. i've taken benadryl for allergies before and it never made me feel weird or anything. like, if i just take a normal dose, what's the actual big deal? seems like a lot of overkill for just trying to sleep.",
